{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 10, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "gates for tbl: 4 input bits -> 8 output bits (1 constant), basis c\n  exact search stopped (node budget at cost 10); Shannon decomposition instead:\n  cost 19, 19 steps (an upper bound, not proved minimal)\n  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 16 care inputs\n  t0 = and(x0, x1)               = x0 & x1\n  t1 = xor(x1, t0)               = x1 xor t0\n  t2 = xor(x1, x2)               = x1 xor x2\n  t3 = and(x0, t2)               = x0 & t2\n  t4 = and(x1, x2)               = x1 & x2\n  t5 = or(x0, t2)                = x0 | t2\n  t6 = and(x2, t5)               = x2 & t5\n  t7 = and(x3, x0)               = x3 & x0\n  t8 = xor(t6, t7)               = t6 xor t7\n  t9 = xor(x0, x1)               = x0 xor x1\n  t10 = and(x2, t9)               = x2 & t9\n  t11 = xor(x1, t10)               = x1 xor t10\n  t12 = xor(t11, t4)               = t11 xor t4\n  t13 = and(x3, t12)               = x3 & t12\n  t14 = xor(t4, t13)               = t4 xor t13\n  t15 = xor(x2, x3)               = x2 xor x3\n  t16 = or(x1, t15)                = x1 | t15\n  t17 = and(x3, t16)               = x3 & t16\n  t18 = and(x2, x3)               = x2 & x3\n  r7 = t18\n  r6 = t17\n  r5 = t14\n  r4 = t8\n  r3 = t3\n  r2 = t1\n  r1 = 0\n  r0 = x0\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 10, "ok": true, "cmd": "gates", "ucas": "gates tbl", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gates", "basis": "c", "input_bits": 4, "output_bits": 8, "constant_bits": 1, "minimal": false, "cost": 19, "steps": 19, "program": [{"dst": "t0", "gate": "and", "args": ["x0", "x1"], "expr": "x0 & x1"}, {"dst": "t1", "gate": "xor", "args": ["x1", "t0"], "expr": "x1 xor t0"}, {"dst": "t2", "gate": "xor", "args": ["x1", "x2"], "expr": "x1 xor x2"}, {"dst": "t3", "gate": "and", "args": ["x0", "t2"], "expr": "x0 & t2"}, {"dst": "t4", "gate": "and", "args": ["x1", "x2"], "expr": "x1 & x2"}, {"dst": "t5", "gate": "or", "args": ["x0", "t2"], "expr": "x0 | t2"}, {"dst": "t6", "gate": "and", "args": ["x2", "t5"], "expr": "x2 & t5"}, {"dst": "t7", "gate": "and", "args": ["x3", "x0"], "expr": "x3 & x0"}, {"dst": "t8", "gate": "xor", "args": ["t6", "t7"], "expr": "t6 xor t7"}, {"dst": "t9", "gate": "xor", "args": ["x0", "x1"], "expr": "x0 xor x1"}, {"dst": "t10", "gate": "and", "args": ["x2", "t9"], "expr": "x2 & t9"}, {"dst": "t11", "gate": "xor", "args": ["x1", "t10"], "expr": "x1 xor t10"}, {"dst": "t12", "gate": "xor", "args": ["t11", "t4"], "expr": "t11 xor t4"}, {"dst": "t13", "gate": "and", "args": ["x3", "t12"], "expr": "x3 & t12"}, {"dst": "t14", "gate": "xor", "args": ["t4", "t13"], "expr": "t4 xor t13"}, {"dst": "t15", "gate": "xor", "args": ["x2", "x3"], "expr": "x2 xor x3"}, {"dst": "t16", "gate": "or", "args": ["x1", "t15"], "expr": "x1 | t15"}, {"dst": "t17", "gate": "and", "args": ["x3", "t16"], "expr": "x3 & t16"}, {"dst": "t18", "gate": "and", "args": ["x2", "x3"], "expr": "x2 & x3"}], "outputs": {"r7": "t18", "r6": "t17", "r5": "t14", "r4": "t8", "r3": "t3", "r2": "t1", "r1": "0", "r0": "x0"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "truth_table", "points": 16, "passed": true, "text": "every output bit on every care input"}], "files": [], "text": "gates for tbl: 4 input bits -> 8 output bits (1 constant), basis c\n  exact search stopped (node budget at cost 10); Shannon decomposition instead:\n  cost 19, 19 steps (an upper bound, not proved minimal)\n  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 16 care inputs\n  t0 = and(x0, x1)               = x0 & x1\n  t1 = xor(x1, t0)               = x1 xor t0\n  t2 = xor(x1, x2)               = x1 xor x2\n  t3 = and(x0, t2)               = x0 & t2\n  t4 = and(x1, x2)               = x1 & x2\n  t5 = or(x0, t2)                = x0 | t2\n  t6 = and(x2, t5)               = x2 & t5\n  t7 = and(x3, x0)               = x3 & x0\n  t8 = xor(t6, t7)               = t6 xor t7\n  t9 = xor(x0, x1)               = x0 xor x1\n  t10 = and(x2, t9)               = x2 & t9\n  t11 = xor(x1, t10)               = x1 xor t10\n  t12 = xor(t11, t4)               = t11 xor t4\n  t13 = and(x3, t12)               = x3 & t12\n  t14 = xor(t4, t13)               = t4 xor t13\n  t15 = xor(x2, x3)               = x2 xor x3\n  t16 = or(x1, t15)                = x1 | t15\n  t17 = and(x3, t16)               = x3 & t16\n  t18 = and(x2, x3)               = x2 & x3\n  r7 = t18\n  r6 = t17\n  r5 = t14\n  r4 = t8\n  r3 = t3\n  r2 = t1\n  r1 = 0\n  r0 = x0\n"}, "isError": false}}
